summary: Test to confirm IOMMU is set to translation mode by default
description: |
    Test to confirm IOMMU is set to translation mode by default, 
    checking dmesg and the files in /sys to assert the translation mode.

    Test inputs:
        journalctl --dmesg --grep 'iommu: Default domain type: Translated' 
        file in /sys/kernel/iommu_groups/*/type
        rlAssertGrep "DMA" "$file"
    Expected resules:
        [   PASS   ] :: Search dmesg for default domain type (Expected 0, got 0)
        [   PASS   ] :: File '/sys/kernel/iommu_groups/*/type' should contain 'DMA' <=== * represents all numbers that exists.
    Results location:
        output.txt
contact: Pablo Martin <pablmart@redhat.com>
id: db730ccf-6de5-46c0-85a6-9133ef9b5ad2
test: bash ./runtest.sh
framework: beakerlib
duration: 10m
